  "interpretation_guardrails": [
    "A signal in a base state is evidence observed in that phase, not proof that the base state should be renamed.",
    "C, A, and B retain their original frozen semantics; this protocol does not modify their thresholds or exit fills.",
    "No state may be assigned because it later produced profit or loss.",
    "No state may use pair identity, year identity, or event identity as a runtime condition.",
    "No economic ranking of base states or evidence channels is permitted in the observational execution.",
